{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/ora-nshama--town-square","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":401,"crm_id":"1419","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Ora","slug":"ora-nshama--town-square","display_address":"Town Square","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Nshama","price":765888,"display_price":"765K","lattitude":25.0036721,"longitude":55.2899235,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Ora is a modern project by Emaar's subsidiary Nshama, located in the picturesque community of Town Square. The complex is a 15-storey building and offers elegant apartments with <strong>1-3 bedrooms</strong>. The building has a classic architecture, facades and interiors are made of the highest quality materials with the use of soft brown and beige shades, thanks to which each residence has a cosy and peaceful atmosphere. All apartments are delivered with fully equipped kitchens and high quality appliances.</p><p>The complex has a swimming pool, gym, fitness centre and children's playground, 24-hour security and laundry service, a picturesque park with many jogging, walking and cycling paths, a barbecue area, a merry-go-round and playgrounds for various sports. There are supermarkets, shops, kindergartens, schools and a medical centre within walking distance.</p><p>Ora is conveniently located in a quiet and developed neighbourhood - Town Square. The Dubai Polo &amp; Equestrian Club is 10 minutes away and the famous Dubai Miracle Garden and Dubai Butterfly Garden are 15 minutes away. Expo City, Jebel Ali Racecourse and Palm Jumeirah are all within 20 minutes' drive, while Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 25 minutes' drive away.</p><p>The development is ideal for couples with children, healthy lifestyle enthusiasts and those who want to live near a picturesque green park away from the bustling city centre.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1419/images/2024/04/18/L8UQPf8mQuufDlv82LGDgNAm7W3J94MSzbnWxYkI.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/18/L8UQPf8mQuufDlv82LGDgNAm7W3J94MSzbnWxYkI.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1419/images/2024/04/18/17sVczGndB5pYVRRMtGZnKZ5ncJlO1MtHDukKf7g.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/18/17sVczGndB5pYVRRMtGZnKZ5ncJlO1MtHDukKf7g.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1419/images/2024/04/18/mwcGwwKLK05Wkuq56JarzWW5wFwGstB5oHs4gXb7.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/18/mwcGwwKLK05Wkuq56JarzWW5wFwGstB5oHs4gXb7.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":3075,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/04/18/CADW7UXobKWVttVjbcuBq8sqEjI33JnjEhd2XGGm.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1407,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1921,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1922,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1923,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"50/50 ","payment_plans":[{"id":6894,"title":"10%","description":"On booking"},{"id":6895,"title":"10%","description":"July 2024"},{"id":6896,"title":"10%","description":"December 2024"},{"id":6897,"title":"10%","description":"June 2025"},{"id